throughout the week closed to-day. The winners of the sections are the Rev. A.
P. Lacey Hulbert (Birmingham), M E. Goldstein (London), J. Macalister (London),
L. Steiner (Buda Pest), P. J. Lawrence (Reading), and C. Duffield (Bristol).
These now play off in a minor tournament, other competitors also continuing in
sectional tournaments, according to strength." (Yorkshire Post and Leeds
Intelligencer, 18 August 1923). May 2019 note: I have corrected the identity
of White to Lajos Steiner (from Endre Steiner, who played in the Major Open)}
1-0

